  "artifact_text": "### Observations and Ruled-Out Leads\n\n**Observations:**\n1. Pod events for `orders-api-7b7dfdc66d-s2556` record readiness probe failures returning HTTP status code 503.\n2. Pod logs display repeated warnings stating `orders-db-primary.demo-apps.svc:5432` is not reachable due to `[Errno -2] Name or service not known`.\n3. The `demo-apps` Service list contains `orders-db`, but no service named `orders-db-primary` exists.\n\n**Ruled-Out Leads:**\n1. Container crash or OOM was ruled out because pod status shows zero restarts and a `Running` state.\n2. A database outage was ruled out because pod `orders-db-59f5787b7-jb5ww` status is `Running` and `Ready`.\n\n### Root Cause\nDeployment log CI-2459 updated `DB_HOST` in ConfigMap `orders-config` to `orders-db-primary.demo-apps.svc:5432` before the database team created that endpoint.\n\n### Recommended Action\nThe orders team should revert `DB_HOST` in ConfigMap `orders-config` to `orders-db.demo-apps.svc:5432` and trigger a rollout restart of `orders-api`.",
